{"id":"vod_sn_37574","vodId":"37574","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"南家三姐妹 我回来了","name_cn":"南家三姐妹 我回来了","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8ecf35cc61cf897e9ca9e3d452322fe3.jpg"},"summary":"春假结束，料峭时节，南家三姐妹妙趣横生的小故事继续上演。散发圣母光芒的大姐春香（佐藤利奈 配音）继续照顾一家人的起居，当然时不时会懒病爆发；最大笑果夏奈（井上麻里奈 配音）在犯傻卖萌的路上高歌猛进，与藤冈（柿原徹也 配音）、理子（高梁碧 配音）以及姐妹闹出不少的笑话；看似不在乎周围一切实则冷静观察众人的千秋（茅原实里 配音），其吐槽功夫日渐纯熟，或者一言不发，或者一语惊人。从清爽的春天到炎热的夏天，朝气蓬勃，青春活力，呆萌的小姐们如约而至……　　本片根据樱场小春的同名漫画改编，是该系列动画的第四季。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u7Z4SJmygV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UP2X9czsxN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/97hbDSFUrp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VC4fEv7uLc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hzyW4JVCPC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HZ4ZsviWQe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bknrA14baM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5UZzhc2TMB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zyUYdCRkkr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wJz8k2Bhzi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k37DRZUz9h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FFw0Qnzphk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1Y3pJR6HeV1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:09.249Z"}